      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -380,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Pinterest (official API v5)\n\n**Video products \u2192 Video Pins** on `PINTEREST_BOARD_ID`:\n1. `POST /v5/media` (media_type video)\n2. tracking-api uploads the local file to the returned S3 form\n3. Poll `GET /v5/media/{id}` until `succeeded`\n4. `POST /v5/pins` with `media_source.source_type = video_id`\n\nImage products \u2192 image Pins (`image_url`).\n\n`validate_only` runs stop before Create Pin and record nothing. `DRY_RUN=true` stops at Duplicate Check.\n",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
